hes the task's admissibility conditions — the other three distinctions' evidence can be supplied by this process's own work. The self-check node re-read both artifacts against their schemas and passed; that outcome is recorded in the ledger as non-authoritative, with deterministic root validation governing. Per the harness ledger note: the spec-summary follows protocol.md v2's shape (`typed_features: true`) where it supersedes the older harness field name."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1517,"cache_read_input_tokens":43088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1517},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d22a302-7a39-45c4-9a26-e3bdaa2ce20a","uuid":"f8401955-8592-41b3-beb8-9af1f0429b49","timestamp":"2026-08-09T20:32:53.790Z","request_id":"req_011Cdsp1ooBUu9qzoCzFvku6"}
